1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,199
Widgets are blocks of content, such as a paragraph or a quote, that

2
00:00:05,199 --> 00:00:07,270
appear in the zones of a page.

3
00:00:07,270 --> 00:00:11,296
In this video, you'll see what a widget is, how to allow widgets

4
00:00:11,296 --> 00:00:14,920
on a content type, and how to add, move, and remove them.

5
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:23,588
A widget is a content item like any other, with fields to fill in.

6
00:00:23,588 --> 00:00:27,769
What makes it a widget is its content type, which carries the Widget

7
00:00:27,769 --> 00:00:31,442
stereotype, a setting that marks the type as a widget type.

8
00:00:31,442 --> 00:00:34,380
Paragraph, Image, and Blockquote are examples.

9
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:37,831
A theme lays out each page in named zones.

10
00:00:37,831 --> 00:00:42,332
The Blog Theme of this site has zones such as Header, Content, and Footer.

11
00:00:42,332 --> 00:00:46,721
A widget appears wherever the theme renders its zone, so zone names must

12
00:00:46,721 --> 00:00:48,690
match the zones of the theme.

13
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:52,185
Widgets can be placed in more than one way.

14
00:00:52,185 --> 00:00:56,443
With the WidgetsList part, each item of a content type chooses its own

15
00:00:56,443 --> 00:00:59,581
widgets for named zones, and this video shows how.

16
00:00:59,581 --> 00:01:02,830
Layers and the Flow part each have a separate video.

17
00:01:07,088 --> 00:01:09,475
Widgets is a feature of its own.

18
00:01:09,475 --> 00:01:12,490
Under Tools, Features, search for Widgets.

19
00:01:12,490 --> 00:01:18,898
Its description says it provides a part allowing content items to render widgets in theme zones.

20
00:01:19,482 --> 00:01:23,027
The row offers Disable because the feature is enabled.

21
00:01:23,027 --> 00:01:26,808
On a site where it is turned off, the button reads Enable.

22
00:01:26,808 --> 00:01:30,352
The Blog recipe, which sets up this site, turns it on.

23
00:01:34,578 --> 00:01:40,578
Widget types are content types, so you find them under Design, Content Definition, Content Types.

24
00:01:41,031 --> 00:01:44,648
Searching the list for Widget shows the widget types:

25
00:01:44,648 --> 00:01:48,326
Blockquote, Container, Image, Paragraph, and Raw Html.

26
00:01:48,326 --> 00:01:50,411
Each carries a Widget badge.

27
00:01:50,863 --> 00:01:52,372
Let's open Paragraph.

28
00:01:52,372 --> 00:01:55,112
The Stereotype field holds the word Widget.

29
00:01:55,112 --> 00:01:58,523
That setting is the only requirement for a widget type.

30
00:01:58,987 --> 00:02:03,537
Lower on the page, the Fields list shows what the widget holds.

31
00:02:03,537 --> 00:02:08,087
Paragraph has one field, Content, edited with a Wysiwyg editor.

32
00:02:08,554 --> 00:02:12,550
To make your own widget type, choose Create new type, add the parts

33
00:02:12,550 --> 00:02:15,944
and fields you need, and enter Widget as its stereotype.

34
00:02:20,147 --> 00:02:23,021
A part adds one capability to a content type.

35
00:02:23,021 --> 00:02:27,360
To let each article choose its own widgets for named zones, the Article

36
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:29,502
type needs the WidgetsList part.

37
00:02:29,502 --> 00:02:34,067
The About page is an Article, so let's edit that type and choose Add Parts.

38
00:02:34,543 --> 00:02:40,421
WidgetsList is described as a way to add widgets to layout zones for your content item.

39
00:02:40,421 --> 00:02:44,403
Add & Configure attaches the part and opens its settings.

40
00:02:45,047 --> 00:02:49,864
Available widgets zones takes a comma separated list of zone names.

41
00:02:49,864 --> 00:02:55,077
Let's enter Content and Footer, two zones of this theme, and choose Save.

42
00:02:55,572 --> 00:03:02,172
The Parts list of Article includes WidgetsList, and every article offers those two zones for widgets.

43
00:03:06,429 --> 00:03:10,313
The Content Items menu entry opens the Manage Content page.

44
00:03:10,313 --> 00:03:12,404
Let's edit the About article.

45
00:03:12,404 --> 00:03:16,646
Further down, the WidgetsList section shows a card for each zone:

46
00:03:16,646 --> 00:03:18,139
Content and Footer.

47
00:03:18,590 --> 00:03:23,077
In the Footer zone, the plus button titled Add Widget opens a list.

48
00:03:23,077 --> 00:03:27,810
It holds every content type with the Widget stereotype, sorted by name.

49
00:03:28,273 --> 00:03:29,837
Let's choose Paragraph.

50
00:03:29,837 --> 00:03:32,424
A card for the widget appears in the zone.

51
00:03:32,424 --> 00:03:36,413
Expand it, and write the text that visitors will read in the footer.

52
00:03:36,901 --> 00:03:40,243
Let's add a Blockquote to the Content zone the same way.

53
00:03:40,243 --> 00:03:42,561
Its only field is Quote, a text area.

54
00:03:45,401 --> 00:03:49,427
Let's choose Publish, which saves the widgets together with the article.

55
00:03:49,427 --> 00:03:54,021
The widgets are stored in the article itself, so they belong to this article alone.

56
00:03:54,473 --> 00:03:58,222
On the About page, the quote is shown in the Content zone, and

57
00:03:58,222 --> 00:04:00,373
the paragraph in the Footer zone.

58
00:04:04,589 --> 00:04:09,090
In the WidgetsList section of an article, each card has a handle on its left.

59
00:04:09,090 --> 00:04:12,505
Drag a card by its handle to change its order, or to move

60
00:04:12,505 --> 00:04:13,969
it into another zone.

61
00:04:14,431 --> 00:04:17,336
The arrow button collapses a card to its header.

62
00:04:17,336 --> 00:04:19,541
Choose it again to expand the card.

63
00:04:20,009 --> 00:04:24,712
Pointing at the header of a card reveals a plus button titled Insert Widget.

64
00:04:24,712 --> 00:04:29,989
It opens the same list of widget types and inserts the chosen widget before that card.

65
00:04:30,464 --> 00:04:33,601
The trash button removes a card after you confirm.

66
00:04:33,601 --> 00:04:37,524
Changes to widgets are saved with the article, not on their own.

67
00:04:39,524 --> 00:04:42,703
Widgets are content items that fill the zones of a page:

68
00:04:42,703 --> 00:04:47,010
mark a content type with the Widget stereotype, attach the WidgetsList part to

69
00:04:47,010 --> 00:04:50,650
the types that need widgets, and choose the widgets of each item.

70
00:04:50,650 --> 00:04:51,984
Thanks for watching.

